OL,5,G0600 AFRODEUTSCHE
OL,6,     FSundays are for staying under the
OL,7,     Fcovers a little longer. Let
OL,8,     FAFRODEUTSCHE turn your morning
OL,9,     Finto a masterclass in calm.
OL,10,G0800 Radcliffe and Maconie
OL,11,     FFollowing 6 Music's T-Shirt Day,
OL,12,     FMark and Stuart celebrate another
OL,13,     Fgreat item of clothing...
OL,14,     Ftrousers! With trouser-themed
OL,15,     Ftracks and chat.
OL,16,G1000 Cerys Matthews
OL,17,     FGid looks at Palme D'or winners
OL,18,     Fahead of the Cannes film festival
OL,19,     Fturning 80. Features music from
OL,20,     FBjork, Chuck Berry, Herbie
OL,21,     FHancock, Nino Rota, Ennio
OL,22,     FMorricone and more.
